<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Studio Tạo Quà - Quà Sinh Nhật Số</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
        body { background: #fdfbf7; color: #1c1917; min-height: 100vh; padding: 40px 8%; }
        
        /* Header navigation */
        .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .back-btn { text-decoration: none; color: #166534; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; background: #e7e5e4; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; }
        
        /* Studio Form Card */
        .studio-card { background: white; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; }
        .studio-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #166534; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; }
        .studio-desc { font-size: 14px; color: #78716c; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #44403c; }
        .form-group input, .form-group textarea, .form-group select { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d6d3d1; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; outline: none; }
        .form-group input:focus { border-color: #166534; }
        
        .btn-submit { width: 100%; padding: 14px; background: #166534; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 10px; }
        .btn-submit:hover { background: #14532d; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <a href="index.html" class="back-btn">← Quay lại Trang Chủ</a>
        <h2>🎨 Studio Tạo Quà</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="studio-card">
        <h1 class="studio-title">Tạo Hộp Quà Sinh Nhật</h1>
        <p class="studio-desc">Điền thông tin bên dưới để khởi tạo trang quà mừng tuổi mới</p>

        <form onsubmit="alert('Đã khởi tạo hộp quà thành công!'); return false;">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Tên người nhận quà:</label>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Ví dụ: Hoàng Anh" required>
            </div>
            
            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Dịp chúc mừng:</label>
                <select>
                    <option>🎂 Sinh Nhật</option>
                    <option>💐 20/10 Phụ Nữ VN</option>
                    <option>💖 14/2 Valentine</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label>Lời chúc mừng:</label>
                <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Nhập lời chúc chân thành của bạn..." required></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">✨ Khởi tạo Hộp Quà 3D</button>
        </form>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
